{"electron-persisted-atom-state":{"electron:onboarding-projectless-completed":true,"last_completed_onboarding":1778126020,"electron:onboarding-workspace-experiment-assignment":{"arm":"control","assignedAtMs":1779255763722,"experimentName":"93537254"},"electron:onboarding-primary-runtime-install-ready":false,"electron:onboarding-primary-runtime-install-requested":true,"electron:onboarding-welcome-pending":true,"composer-auto-context-enabled":false,"agent-mode-by-host-id":{"local":"auto"},"sidebar-collapsed-groups":{"C:\\Users\\gavri\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-05-06\\hi-i-would-like-to-build":true},"prompt-history":{"global":[],"new-conversation":["Refactor the Gavriel Clock color and theme system to be simpler and more intentional.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nCORE COLOR DIRECTION\r\n====================\r\n\r\nThe app should NOT have a large multi-color theme system.\r\n\r\nInstead, keep a small curated set of meaningful options.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nTHEME OPTIONS (SIMPLIFIED)\r\n==========================\r\n\r\nKeep ONLY these theme/accent options:\r\n\r\n1. Blue (CURRENT DEFAULT)\r\n\r\n* This is the main identity of the app\r\n* Keep it as the default theme\r\n\r\n2. Green (RESTORE EARLIER VERSION STYLE)\r\n\r\n* Bring back the original green accent from earlier versions\r\n* Should feel calm, clean, and productive\r\n* Can be selected as an alternative theme\r\n\r\n========================\r\nREMOVE THE FOLLOWING THEMES\r\n===========================\r\n\r\nRemove or do NOT include:\r\n\r\n* purple theme\r\n* orange theme\r\n* excessive multi-color palette options\r\n\r\nKeep the system minimal and intentional.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nFUNCTIONAL COLOR (NOT A THEME)\r\n==============================\r\n\r\nRed should NOT be a selectable theme.\r\n\r\nInstead, use red ONLY for functional states:\r\n\r\n* clock out button\r\n* overtime indicator\r\n* warnings / end-of-shift alerts\r\n\r\nRed is a UI status color, not a theme option.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nDESIGN GOAL\r\n===========\r\n\r\nThe theme system should feel:\r\n\r\n* minimal\r\n* intentional\r\n* emotionally consistent\r\n* not overly customizable\r\n\r\nAvoid turning it into a color picker system.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nUI INTENT\r\n=========\r\n\r\n* Blue = default identity\r\n* Green = nostalgic / calm alternative\r\n* Red = system feedback only\r\n\r\nThis keeps the app feeling:\r\n\r\n* premium\r\n* focused\r\n* not cluttered\r\n* visually consistent ["],"019e43eb-513e-7313-b4fa-3702306e52f0":["where can  I access it? ","Replace all existing shift history data in Gavriel Clock.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nDATA RESET\r\n==========\r\n\r\nDelete ALL current / sample / placeholder shift records.\r\n\r\nThe app should ONLY use the real shift data provided below.\r\n\r\nDo NOT merge with existing data.\r\n\r\nDo NOT keep any previous test entries.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nNEW SHIFT HISTORY DATA\r\n======================\r\n\r\nAdd these shifts exactly as recorded:\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tue, May 19\r\n\r\nClock In: 8:52:16 AM\r\nClock Out: 6:13:56 PM\r\nDuration: 09:21:39\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Mon, May 18\r\n\r\nClock In: 8:26:21 AM\r\nClock Out: 5:04:43 PM\r\nDuration: 08:38:21\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Fri, May 15\r\n\r\nClock In: 8:19:13 AM\r\nClock Out: 2:20:03 PM\r\nDuration: 06:00:49\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Thu, May 14\r\n\r\nClock In: 8:50:34 AM\r\nClock Out: 5:34:16 PM\r\nDuration: 08:43:41\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Wed, May 13\r\n\r\nClock In: 8:59:14 AM\r\nClock Out: 5:29:56 PM\r\nDuration: 08:30:41\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tue, May 12\r\n\r\nClock In: 8:31:10 AM\r\nClock Out: 5:05:19 PM\r\nDuration: 08:34:08\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Mon, May 11\r\n\r\nClock In: 8:32:22 AM\r\nClock Out: 5:06:10 PM\r\nDuration: 08:33:47\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Fri, May 8\r\n\r\nClock In: 8:26:49 AM\r\nClock Out: 2:34:50 PM\r\nDuration: 06:08:01\r\n\r\n========================\r\nDATA STRUCTURE REQUIREMENT\r\n==========================\r\n\r\nStore each shift as a structured object:\r\n\r\n* date\r\n* clockIn\r\n* clockOut\r\n* duration\r\n\r\nEnsure consistency across all records.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nUI IMPACT\r\n=========\r\n\r\n* Shift History should ONLY display these entries\r\n* Remove all fake/sample data\r\n* Ensure totals/analytics (if present) update based only on this dataset\r\n\r\n========================\r\nGOAL\r\n====\r\n\r\nThe app should now reflect accurate real-world work history only, with no placeholder or demo data remaining.\r","Refactor the Calendar + Shift Detail system in Gavriel Clock to be clean, minimal, and properly separated.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nCORE DESIGN GOAL\r\n================\r\n\r\nSeparate the app into two clear layers:\r\n\r\n1. Calendar = quick visual overview\r\n2. Shift Detail = full information + editing\r\n\r\nAvoid duplicating full shift data in the calendar grid.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nCALENDAR VIEW (SIMPLIFIED)\r\n==========================\r\n\r\nThe calendar should remain minimal and easy to scan.\r\n\r\nEach day should show ONLY:\r\n\r\n* A small indicator if a shift exists (dot or subtle marker)\r\n* Optional: total hours for that day (small, secondary text)\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\n* ● (worked day indicator)\r\n* 8h 34m (small text under date, optional)\r\n\r\nDO NOT show full shift details inside calendar cells.\r\n\r\nKeep calendar visually clean and lightweight.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nCALENDAR INTERACTION\r\n====================\r\n\r\nWhen a user clicks a day:\r\n\r\nOpen a Shift Detail view (modal or slide-up panel).\r\n\r\nThis is where all shift information lives.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nSHIFT DETAIL VIEW (MAIN FEATURE)\r\n================================\r\n\r\nThe Shift Detail screen should display full information clearly:\r\n\r\nRequired fields:\r\n\r\n* Date\r\n* Clock in time\r\n* Clock out time\r\n* Total duration\r\n\r\nOptional fields (if available):\r\n\r\n* Notes\r\n* Overtime / undertime\r\n* Manual adjustments (if used)\r\n\r\n========================\r\nSHIFT DETAIL ACTIONS\r\n====================\r\n\r\nInside Shift Detail, allow:\r\n\r\n* Edit shift times\r\n* Add/edit notes\r\n* Delete shift\r\n* View overtime (if applicable)\r\n\r\nThis is the ONLY place where editing happens.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS\r\n===================\r\n\r\nShift Detail should feel:\r\n\r\n* clean\r\n* calm\r\n* structured\r\n* mobile-friendly\r\n* not cluttered\r\n\r\nUse:\r\n\r\n* simple card layout\r\n* clear labels\r\n* spacing between sections\r\n* minimal styling\r\n\r\nAvoid:\r\n\r\n* dashboards\r\n* charts\r\n* analytics\r\n* unnecessary summaries\r\n\r\n========================\r\nDATA FLOW RULE\r\n==============\r\n\r\nCalendar pulls data from shift history only.\r\n\r\nShift Detail is the source of truth for:\r\n\r\n* viewing\r\n* editing\r\n* correcting shifts\r\n\r\nCalendar never duplicates full shift UI.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nGOAL\r\n====\r\n\r\nCreate a clean, professional two-layer system:\r\n\r\nCalendar = fast overview\r\nShift Detail = full interaction + editing\r\n\r\nThis keeps the app simple, scalable, and avoids dashboard clutter while improving usability.\r","Simplify the Settings section in Gavriel Clock by removing unnecessary options and reducing clutter.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nREMOVE FROM SETTINGS\r\n====================\r\n\r\nDelete completely:\r\n\r\n1. Compact layout option\r\n\r\n* Remove any toggle or setting related to compact vs relaxed layout\r\n\r\n2. Settings description text\r\n\r\n* Remove the subtitle under Settings that says:\r\n  “Personalize Gavriel Clock”\r\n* Settings page should start immediately with options (no intro text)\r\n\r\n3. Notifications tab\r\n\r\n* Remove the entire Notifications section/tab\r\n* Remove all notification-related settings and logic\r\n\r\n========================\r\nNEW SETTINGS STRUCTURE\r\n======================\r\n\r\nSettings should now be minimal and clean:\r\n\r\nONLY keep:\r\n\r\n* Appearance (themes + accent colors only)\r\n* anything essential already required for app function\r\n\r\nNO extra categories unless absolutely necessary.\r\n\r\n========================\r\nDESIGN GOAL\r\n===========\r\n\r\nThe Settings page should feel:\r\n\r\n* minimal\r\n* fast to scroll\r\n* uncluttered\r\n* focused only on visual customization\r\n\r\nAvoid:\r\n\r\n* multi-section configuration menus\r\n* unnecessary personalization options\r\n* “feature-heavy” settings design\r\n\r\n========================\r\nUI RULE\r\n=======\r\n\r\nSettings should feel like:\r\n\r\n> “quick visual preferences”\r\n\r\nNOT:\r\n\r\n> a control panel or system dashboard  ","where do i find this in files"]},"electron:onboarding-hide-first-new-thread-promos":false,"heartbeat-thread-permissions-by-id":{"019e43eb-513e-7313-b4fa-3702306e52f0":{"approvalPolicy":"on-request","approvalsReviewer":"user","sandboxPolicy":{"type":"workspaceWrite","writableRoots":["C:\\Users\\gavri\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-05-20\\refactor-the-gavriel-clock-color-and"],"excludeSlashTmp":false,"excludeTmpdirEnvVar":false,"networkAccess":false}}}},"electron-main-window-bounds":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":1280,"height":720,"isMaximized":false},"conversationDetailMode":"STEPS_COMMANDS","projectless-thread-ids":["019e0092-5079-7d03-a334-a5de28f2caa4","019e00e8-4998-7932-9d7c-c3f3c0800f78","019e43eb-513e-7313-b4fa-3702306e52f0"],"thread-workspace-root-hints":{"019e0092-5079-7d03-a334-a5de28f2caa4":"C:\\Users\\gavri\\Documents\\Codex","019e00e8-4998-7932-9d7c-c3f3c0800f78":"C:\\Users\\gavri\\Documents\\Codex","019e43eb-513e-7313-b4fa-3702306e52f0":"C:\\Users\\gavri\\Documents\\Codex"},"remote-project-connection-backfill-completed":true,"use-copilot-auth-if-available":false,"electron-saved-workspace-roots":["C:\\Users\\gavri\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-05-06\\hi-i-would-like-to-build"],"project-order":["C:\\Users\\gavri\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-05-06\